	"Description": "[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]\n<br />使得[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/29979]丰饶美人[/url]的高清精灵图可以在Xtardew的事件中展示出来，同时绘制丰饶美人中角色的特定Xtardew场景图，并且修复玛鲁的图片分辨率问题，同时恢复大量旧版本Xtardew事件。#如果原作者通知将立即删除\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#d4d4d8]将文件夹覆盖对应的文件夹既可。[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Describe the core features of your mod[/color][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Provide info on additional required steps, resources, or mods[/color][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Shout outs[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#D4D4D8]Thanks to [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/TheMud]@TheMud[/url]'s great work. And [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/GabrAil22?gameId=1303]@GabrAil22[/url]’s English translation.[/color]",
